<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="7" background-color="accent" padding="34pt 12pt 30pt">
      <p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">SCOPE</p>
      <p role="caption">03 / 10</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="53" padding="34pt 42pt 30pt 36pt">
      <labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels>
      <h2>Scope is defined by deliverables, boundaries, and acceptance evidence</h2>
      <p>Four deliverables replace a general promise to “improve support.” Each closes only when its acceptance evidence is attached.</p>
      <grid spacing="small">
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" cell-decor="top-line">
          <h3>Unified intake</h3>
          <p font-size="sm">One validated structure for email, chat, and web. Accept when required fields, consent, duplicate checks, and acknowledgement behavior pass.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" cell-decor="top-line">
          <h3>Routing configuration</h3>
          <p font-size="sm">Eight categories, priority rules, queue ownership, and supervisor overrides. Accept when representative scenarios route correctly.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" cell-decor="top-line">
          <h3>Operational enablement</h3>
          <p font-size="sm">Launch runbook, training, escalation path, and rollback. Accept when designated supervisors complete a rehearsal.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" cell-decor="top-line">
          <h3>Reporting</h3>
          <p font-size="sm">Queue health, routing accuracy, backlog age, and overrides. Accept when refresh and reconciliation thresholds are met.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item colspan="27">
          <p role="eyebrow">Outside scope</p>
          <p font-size="sm">CRM replacement · workforce planning · cleanup beyond 90 days · customer-facing policy changes.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="33">
          <p role="eyebrow">Dependencies</p>
          <p font-size="sm">Identity roles · API access · analytics export capacity · approved categories · supervisor availability · release authority.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>